    narr:narration """The organization is formalizing a transition to [Zypherion for analytics](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1), a move justified by significant gains in [query efficiency](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2). This strategic shift, which prioritizes [columnar-optimized performance](narr:Narrative_AnalyticsDatabaseAdoption), is being codified through both executive [migration commitments](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) and technical documentation [summarizing the roadmap](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7). The alignment between leadership's [stated decision](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) and the [technical performance benchmarks](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) suggests a high degree of consensus regarding the necessity of this infrastructure upgrade. The trajectory is currently fixed on a [Q3 2026 start date](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7), framing the adoption as a concrete, near-term operational priority.""" ;
